          <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Roboto;">
            <span style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Pursuant to Section 22.3 of the General Terms and Conditions of Gulf Run's FERC Gas Tariff, Original Volume No. 1,</span>
            <span style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"> Docket No. RP25-875-000, as approved by FERC's order issued on May 14, 2025.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH4C1BFFAC6E66D1761184561630FBE94A" xlink:to="HHA771689B99D40B6DAF54F968720FC0B3" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH38CDC632689E97053821709991A84A6D" xlink:label="HH38CDC632689E97053821709991A84A6D" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHE542FFB42F863D59AC21B23FAD0FB5DF" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <div>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Roboto;">
            <span style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); float: none; display: inline !important;">
              <span style="font-size: 12pt;">
                <strong style="font-weight: bold;">Schedule Page: 278 Line No.: 2 Column: a</strong>
              </span>
            </span>
          </p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Roboto;">
            <span style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); float: none; display: inline !important;">Pursuant to Section 9 of the General Terms and Conditions ("GT&amp;C") of Gulf Run's FERC Gas Tariff, Original Volume No. 1, Docket No. RP26-123-000 filed with FERC on October 25, 2025, Gulf Run </span>
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
              <span style="font-size: 12pt;">is required to credit to eligible firm </span>
            </span>
            <span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit;">customers penalty revenues collected during the Penalty Base Period. The annual base period runs August 1 through July 31. Under the </span>
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
              <span style="font-size: 12pt;">terms of Section 9.6 of the GT&amp;C, Gulf Run is not required to calculate revenue credits until the total penalty crediting revenues exceed </span>
            </span>
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
              <span style="font-size: 12pt;">$250,000.</span>
            </span>
          </p>
          <p>
            <span style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); float: none; display: inline !important;">&#160;</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH38CDC632689E97053821709991A84A6D" xlink:to="HHE542FFB42F863D59AC21B23FAD0FB5DF" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHE0A4A8CC1C74E7F95B54EE1DD4E28516" xlink:label="HHE0A4A8CC1C74E7F95B54EE1DD4E28516" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHC6CAED9725165C927134DF2F70B4E634" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <img title="Screenshot 2026-05-20 092016.jpg" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="" width="421" height="163" />
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHE0A4A8CC1C74E7F95B54EE1DD4E28516" xlink:to="HHC6CAED9725165C927134DF2F70B4E634" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH0F125AE2B5CDF7BA9C50D7DA84BEC797" xlink:label="HH0F125AE2B5CDF7BA9C50D7DA84BEC797" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH69095E872B5B950F03141220DA2EBBB7" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #333333; font-family: Roboto;">
          <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">
            <span style="font-size: 12pt;">
              <strong>Schedule Page: 278 Line No.: 3 Column: a</strong>
            </span>
          </span>
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #333333; font-family: Roboto;">
          <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Pursuant to Section 22.3 of the General Terms and Conditions of Gulf Run's FERC Gas Tariff, Original Volume No. 1, Docket No. RP25-875-000, as approved by FERC's order issued on May 14, 2025.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH0F125AE2B5CDF7BA9C50D7DA84BEC797" xlink:to="HH69095E872B5B950F03141220DA2EBBB7" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH7A4474C5E4DE719A078D964967F64560" xlink:label="HH7A4474C5E4DE719A078D964967F64560" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH7ECBB2FDAE4CCE6B22F0980C43811034" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #000000; font-family: Roboto;">
          <span style="font-size: 12pt;">
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
              <strong>Schedule Page: 520 Line No.: 3 Columns: c and d</strong>
            </span>
          </span>
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #000000; font-family: Roboto;">
          <span style="font-size: 12pt;">
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
              <span style="color: #333333;">Gas purchase expense was booked to Natural gas transmission line purchases, Account 803.</span>
            </span>
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH7A4474C5E4DE719A078D964967F64560" xlink:to="HH7ECBB2FDAE4CCE6B22F0980C43811034" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHAD77D2B4622315B60DE502986E4668C3" xlink:label="HHAD77D2B4622315B60DE502986E4668C3" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHBB9D7FD7A04E69638466FD27091CD13B" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <strong style="font-family: Roboto; font-size: 16px; color: #333333;">
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;">Schedule Page: 520 Line No.: 29.1 Columns: c and d</span>
          </strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          <img title="Screenshot 2026-05-20 092536.jpg" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="" width="511" height="147" />
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHAD77D2B4622315B60DE502986E4668C3" xlink:to="HHBB9D7FD7A04E69638466FD27091CD13B" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHE42A88354FE811940E49AF98CC4875FD" xlink:label="HHE42A88354FE811940E49AF98CC4875FD" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHD8146F26CF23CAB22EFF75F5B08A90DA" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #000000; font-family: Roboto;">
          <span style="font-size: 12pt;">
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
              <strong>Schedule Page: 521 Line No.: 7 Column: f</strong>
            </span>
          </span>
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0px; color: #000000; font-family: Roboto;">
          <span style="font-size: 12pt;">
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">The basis for valuing the gas reported in columns (f), (g) and (h) is the weighted average rate for system gas.</span>
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHE42A88354FE811940E49AF98CC4875FD" xlink:to="HHD8146F26CF23CAB22EFF75F5B08A90DA" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH13A6EC4FBA0B316EB0C6AAA04F16829C" xlink:label="HH13A6EC4FBA0B316EB0C6AAA04F16829C" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHDFF225455C2A186194C3C50A4CC9E75E" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #000000; font-family: Roboto;">
          <span style="font-size: 12pt;">
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
              <strong>Schedule Page: 521 Line No.: 7 Column: i</strong>
            </span>
          </span>
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #000000; font-family: Roboto;">
          <em style="color: #333333; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;">
            <span style="font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400;">Gulf Run does not recognize revenues for shipper-supplied fuel and values only the net excess or deficiency volume as reported on line 37. The dollars reported for lines 1-30 on this page are allocated to these categories using current average market prices.</span>
          </em>
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH13A6EC4FBA0B316EB0C6AAA04F16829C" xlink:to="HHDFF225455C2A186194C3C50A4CC9E75E" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHF954BDD3127828E1BCA0358719386A04" xlink:label="HHF954BDD3127828E1BCA0358719386A04" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHC82B37A84FFA40755DF4361182990D44" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #000000; font-family: Roboto;">
          <span style="font-size: 12pt;">
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
              <strong>Schedule Page: 521 Line No.: 22 Column: i</strong>
            </span>
          </span>
          <span style="font-size: 12pt;">
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
              <br />
            </span>
          </span>
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0px; color: #000000; font-family: Roboto;">
          <span style="color: #333333; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Gas used for other operational purposes includes blow-downs and other operational uses of gas other than compressor station fuel, and in-kind volumes of gas delivered to other pipelines in accordance with applicable transportation contracts.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHF954BDD3127828E1BCA0358719386A04" xlink:to="HHC82B37A84FFA40755DF4361182990D44" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH3EB1612345BAC43EAE83A77596A18B2E" xlink:label="HH3EB1612345BAC43EAE83A77596A18B2E" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHFC6DA02CD0CAE09C42F2153905E19006" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #000000; font-family: Roboto;">
          <span style="font-size: 12pt;">
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
              <strong>Schedule Page: 521 Lines No.: 51 and 65 Column: i</strong>
            </span>
          </span>
          <span style="font-size: 12pt;">
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
              <br />
            </span>
          </span>
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0px; color: #000000; font-family: Roboto;">
          <em style="color: #333333; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;">
            <span style="font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400;">Cumulative volumes of in-kind gas owed to or due from shippers are revalued to market price each month. The dollars reported reflects the net valuation for the current month volumes and excludes the revaluation adjustment.</span>
          </em>
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH3EB1612345BAC43EAE83A77596A18B2E" xlink:to="HHFC6DA02CD0CAE09C42F2153905E19006" order="1" />
  </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrli:xbrl>